msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:128
#: a791d83c548c42918df5ba227456122f
msgid "Ethernet is available on 4 output pads and has internal magnetics supporting direct connection to external equipment, no need for a large RJ45 connector."
